right[128] "","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","","";
main(){
    extrn left,right,char,lchar,putchar;
    auto i,p;
    p="last";i=0;
    while(i<128){
        if(char(left[i],0)!=4 | char(right[i],0)!=4) return(1);
        i++;
    }
    lchar(left[0],0,88);
    if(left[0]==right[0] | left[0]==left[1]) return(2);
    if(char(left[0],0)!=88 | char(left[1],0)!=4 | char(right[0],0)!=4) return(3);
